      "statement": "Layer 4 (OSS Link Rewriting) rewrites /oss/ paths to include language prefixes (python/javascript) for versioned builds, inserting the language name after 'oss'. Links already specifying a language or referencing language-agnostic paths (/oss/deepagents/code, /oss/openwiki) and image paths are left unchanged.",
