      "id": "claim_22de30d219c6447a888ffac24a9f0995",
      "statement": "Conditional rendering is a whole-document regular-expression substitution, not a code-fence-aware parser: it requires matching indentation for its opening and closing fences, does not support a structured nested-block model, and can transform apparent conditional syntax inside a Markdown code fence unless the markers are escaped.",
